Bundled skills
================

Add image-owned skills here as either:

  <name>/SKILL.md

or a flat:

  <name>.md

Each file needs YAML frontmatter with `name` and `description`. The image
copies this directory to `/opt/dsh/skills`; the runtime scans it through
`DSH_BUNDLED_SKILL_DIR`, read-only, outside `/data`. Do not put README.md here:
the provider would treat it as a flat skill candidate and reject it for
missing frontmatter. This `README` file has no `.md` extension for that reason.
